 "quest": {
  "id": "quest_first_keen_edge",
  "intro": "A scout of the Fian watches you swing and says: any blade lands. A true blade lands where it hurts. Forge a Ceilg knife, land three critical hits on training dummies, and bring proof of the keen edge.",
  "links_to": [
   "quest_age_iv_runes",
   "quest_sielguir_trial"
  ]
 },
 "java_notes": "Register attributes crit_chance and crit_damage (ranged, synced). Hook the server damage event after combo and parry; one roll per primary target; clamp to 0.75 and 3.0; max-of rule vs fall crit. Send crit_result packet for particles and sound. Add crit.* config section. Publish crit_landed event. Read mob flag from config. Enchantments, items and runes stay pure data."
}